{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"22fe17ab38cfeb456ae151d98625e66bc75b6ca45ce66a1d97f9d67e9bde5866","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LpNxJ9i6zD7xopWnHrFWWr","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/memory/project_post_0_10_2_plan.md","content":"---\nname: project-post-0-10-2-plan\ndescription: \"Where the current work plan lives (.claude/plans/NEXT-WORK.md, local only, rewritten 2026-10-23), and that older plans are in .claude/plans/archive/.\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  modified: 2026-10-23\n---\n\nThe plan for what comes next is `.claude/plans/NEXT-WORK.md` (local only, git-excluded, never commit or PR it). It was rewritten on 2026-10-23 after the earlier plans turned out to be mostly shipped (0.14.0 is released). Superseded plans (V1-REVIEW-2026-10-20, D01-DECISIONS, NPM-PUBLISH-WAVE, MICHI-GRAPH-BRIEF, MICHI-0.6-HANDOFF) are in `.claude/plans/archive/`. The in-repo roadmap is `docs/projects/ROAD-TO-V1.md` (remaining work only).\n\n**Why:** the V1-REVIEW defects A1-A13 and the T06/T06-HISTORY/T08 tasks have shipped; trusting the old plans made the 2026-10-23 triage start from stale lists.\n\n**How to apply:** read NEXT-WORK.md first, but verify an item against the code or the binary before treating it as open. Delete a plan item when it ships. See [[feedback-prove-with-the-real-tool]] and [[measure-value-before-building]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WwTfmxhGbHz8ByFmqhh8q6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/memory && ls project_pr101_hardening_state.md && sed -n 1,6p project_pr101_hardening_state.md | cut -c1-200","description":"Look at the PR 101 memory before deleting it","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
