{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01RnkWesCzJyeY97T2UxQPcQ","lastSequenceNum":4761,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"7df65cce-19b0-4204-a6c4-6af4f314ab19","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3c3a3639-3f25-4da0-a04d-6fa0a8c4ffa2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W9gPVDWnwPY4EbyS2Wt3Xp","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /tmp/claude-501/body_cleanup.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"635a6445-6d10-4bbf-9b94-9361ad215109","timestamp":"2026-10-24T03:22:17.861Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/tmp/claude-501/body_cleanup.md","content":"Removes docs, comments and code that describe behavior that has since changed, found by checking each against the current code and the 0.14.0 binary.\n\nPlans:\n\n- `docs/projects/V1-FINDINGS.md`, `V1-IMPLEMENTATION.md` and `V1-SYSTEM-HARDENING.json` are deleted. Their tasks (canonical references, historical tag ownership, one tag and release per package, per-distribution publish ordering, the redacted failure tail) have shipped, and AGENTS.md says to delete a plan once its work ships.\n- `ROAD-TO-V1.md` is rewritten to what is actually left: Co-located Cargo/Maturin, production-path registry tests for Cargo and PyPI, native fixture evidence, the first-release timing, the target table, and the open owner decisions.\n- Links to the deleted files in ARCHITECTURE.md, the specs index, `REQ-DX-V1.md`, the architecture docs and nine ADRs now point at the roadmap or at git history (`git show 07154021c:...`). Two ADR sentences that claimed a gap was still open (Python file-set completion, rename and demotion ownership) now state the shipped behavior.\n\nDocs:\n\n- `polyglot-v1.md` says which parts are implemented; `config.md` and `identity.md` say the ecosystem is required (E317) and drop the removed `resolve_unique`.\n- `release.md` no longer lists action inputs the action does not have, and shows the real `npm view` command.\n- `publishing.md` says `release` refuses snapshots (E169) and no longer calls the `execute` job \"protected\", since the repo has no Environment.\n- `CONTRIBUTING.md` uses `ecosystem/name:severity` and lists all five preflight targets.\n\nCode:\n\n- Help for `add --package` and `matrix --package` shows `ecosystem/name`. Comments that used the colon form or named the removed `validate` command are corrected.\n- `TagTemplate::render_floating_major` and `GitAccess::create_floating_major` are removed with their tests. The floating tag is moved by `.github/scripts/move-floating-tag.sh`, and nothing else called them.\n\nNot changed, for you to decide:\n\n- `proto/callisto.toml` lists only macOS arm64 and Linux x64, although Intel macOS and arm64 Linux binaries are now published.\n- `matrix.rs` maps `x86_64-apple-darwin` to the retired `macos-13` runner.\n- ADR 12 is still \"Proposed\"; its conditions look met, and accepting it is yours.\n\n`just ci` passes.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"94486e5d-1971-48ae-9d00-eb8bf4a3bd7b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","branch":"docs/cleanup-stale","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":3,"modified":29,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7df65cce-19b0-4204-a6c4-6af4f314ab19","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"exter