{"parentUuid":"e4ad101d-6391-4595-94f0-0d4f9104bdf3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgLLxoc5uGxVpkpA6qgPx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The stale-material cleanup is open as PR #343, and `just ci` passes. I used two read-only agents to find stale text, then checked their findings against the code before editing.\n\n- **Plans in the repo:**\n  - I deleted three shipped plan files in `docs/projects` (`V1-FINDINGS.md`, `V1-IMPLEMENTATION.md`, `V1-SYSTEM-HARDENING.json`).\n  - `ROAD-TO-V1.md` is now short: Maturin, production-path Cargo and PyPI registry tests, native fixture evidence, the unmeasured first-release time, the target table, and the open owner decisions.\n  - Links to the deleted files in `ARCHITECTURE.md`, the specs index, `REQ-DX-V1.md`, the architecture docs and nine ADRs now point to the roadmap or to git history. Two ADR sentences that said a gap was open now state the shipped behavior.\n- **Docs and code docs:**\n  - `polyglot-v1.md` is marked as partly implemented.\n  - `config.md`, `identity.md`, `release.md` and `publishing.md` no longer mention the removed `resolve_unique`, non-existent action inputs, a wrong `npm view` command, a bare-name rule, or a \"protected\" `execute` job.\n  - `CONTRIBUTING.md` now uses `ecosystem/name:severity` and lists all five preflight targets.\n  - The `add --package` and `matrix --package` help and some comments still used the colon or bare form or named the removed `validate` command. They are fixed.\n  - A changeset covers the user-visible help text.\n- **Dead code:** I removed `render_floating_major` and `create_floating_major` with their tests, because only the floating-tag script moves that tag now.\n- **Local plans** (not in the repo):\n  - The consumed ones went into `.claude/plans/archive/`.\n  - `NEXT-WORK.md` is rewritten to the current state.\n  - Two stale memory entries are deleted and one is updated.\n\nI did not change these, since they're yours to decide:\n- **ADR 12:** it's still \"Proposed\", and its acceptance conditions look met.\n- **`proto/callisto.toml`:** it omits the Intel macOS and arm64 Linux binaries we now publish.\n- **`matrix.rs` runner:** it maps Intel macOS to the retired `macos-13` runner.\n\nThe review's claim that about 14% of spec criteria are wrong is the largest stale item left. I haven't re-checked it since the fixes, so say if you want that pass next.\n\nMerge order: #342, then #341, #343 and #340, which should merge after #342 so the release PR drops the hints changesets.\n\nresult: Cleanup PR #343 is open with CI green. It removes shipped plans, fixes stale docs, comments and help text, and deletes two unused helpers. The remaining items are your decisions."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2022,"cache_read_input_tokens":424782,"output_tokens":965,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2022,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":965,"cache_read_input_tokens":424782,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2022,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2022},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"57b46aa2-dcd1-4550-9499-88c3ff7ac56e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgLLxoDGqkgUygLpCBLVs","requestRef":"cd242443-1412-4c47-a505-95b02ec701f8","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"70ee259b-3139-4e0e-b54b-5ac6801928a9","timestamp":"2026-10-24T03:23:03.676Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f2